sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as Developer / Web Dashboard
    participant API as FlagOps Admin API (/api/v1)
    participant Crypto as Crypto Module (AES-256-GCM)
    participant Schema as JSON Schema Validator
    participant PG as PostgreSQL 16
    participant Audit as Audit Logger
    participant Redis as Redis Pub/Sub

    Dev->>API: PUT /namespaces/{ns}/items (key, value, is_secret, json_schema)
    alt is_secret == True
        API->>Crypto: encrypt_secret(value, master_key)
        Crypto-->>API: encrypted_ciphertext
    end
    alt json_schema is not null
        API->>Schema: validate_json_schema(value, json_schema)
    end
    API->>PG: Upsert ConfigItem (trạng thái Draft nháp)
    API-->>Dev: 200 OK (Item updated as draft)

    Dev->>API: GET /namespaces/{ns}/diff (So sánh Draft vs Current Release)
    API->>PG: Load current release snapshot & draft items
    API->>API: Compute 3-way diff (Added, Modified, Removed)
    API-->>Dev: 200 OK (diff items payload)

    Dev->>API: POST /namespaces/{ns}/publish (comment="Release v5")
    API->>PG: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API->>PG: Freeze draft items into new ConfigRelease(version=N+1, snapshot=JSONB)
    API->>PG: Update ConfigNamespace.current_release_id
    API->>Audit: Ghi nhận AuditLog(action="CONFIG_PUBLISH", entity="release")
    API->>PG: COMMIT
    API->>Redis: PUBLISH flagops:invalidation (event="config_published")
    API-->>Dev: 201 Created (Release v5 active)

    Note over Dev, Redis: Quy trình Rollback (Nếu bản phát hành mới gặp sự cố)
    Dev->>API: POST /releases/{old_release_id}/rollback
    API->>PG: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API->>PG: Tạo ConfigRelease mới (version=N+2, is_rollback_of=old_release_id, snapshot=old_snapshot)
    API->>PG: Đồng bộ ngược lại ConfigItems
    API->>Audit: Ghi nhận AuditLog(action="CONFIG_ROLLBACK")
    API->>PG: COMMIT
    API->>Redis: PUBLISH flagops:invalidation
    API-->>Dev: 200 OK (Rollback thành công)
